WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.060
Three days after surgery, you may shower

2
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.180
and wash your hair.

3
00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:08.780
Your wound check and ear exam are about two

4
00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.780
weeks after surgery —

5
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.620
the stitches dissolve on their own.

6
00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:15.620
Take your pain medicine the way it was prescribed.

7
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.100
Take it before the pain gets bad.
